<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Baguio project sees brisk sales.</title>
<headline>Ayala Baguio project sees brisk sales.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Land Inc said on Thursday its 102-unit residential project in the mountain resort Baguio city was already 90 percent sold.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the Pineridge project was nearly sold out after less than two months from its launch.</p>
<p>The project will rise on a 7,700 square metre site, 60 percent of which will be maintained as open space.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
